  "notes": "Text Input is a simple input field.\n\nNeeds daisyUI installed (npm i -D daisyui, then @plugin \"daisyui\" in your CSS).\n\nOriginal file: https://github.com/saadeghi/daisyui/blob/master/packages/docs/src/routes/(routes)/components/input/+page.md",
  "code": "<label class=\"input validator\">\n  <svg class=\"h-[1em] opacity-50\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n    <g\n      stroke-linejoin=\"round\"\n      stroke-linecap=\"round\"\n      stroke-width=\"2.5\"\n      fill=\"none\"\n      stroke=\"currentColor\"\n    >\n      <path d=\"M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71\"></path>\n      <path d=\"M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71\"></path>\n    </g>\n  </svg>\n  <input\n    type=\"url\"\n    required\n    placeholder=\"https://\"\n    value=\"https://\"\n    pattern=\"^(https?://)?([a-zA-Z0-9]([a-zA-Z0-9\\\\-].*[a-zA-Z0-9])?\\\\.)+[a-zA-Z].*$\"\n    title=\"Must be valid URL\"\n  />\n</label>\n<p class=\"validator-hint\">Must be valid URL</p>",
